    {
      "entryId": "zep-3-8",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The determination to gather kingdoms and pour indignation; earth devoured by jealous fire. First principle: waiting is commanded against a determined gathering — the jealous-fire day is fixed by God's resolve.",
