    {
      "entryId": "zep-2-3",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Righteousness and meekness sought, hidden in the anger-day. First principle: the hiding option — meek-seekers may be hid when the day pours; judgment has a refuge class.",
